Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): mobile app shell and phone-first login

- shell: bottom tab bar (>=56px targets, safe-area aware) replaces the chip row; shown only for roles with 2+ workspaces
- shell: compact header (brand mark + title), desktop-only command search, icon-only Ledger on phones
- login: one-screen, two-step (number then code), bilingual, no implementation details shown to users;
  dev role switcher collapsed and dev-only
- i18n: login.* keys in en/ml
